My plan is to navigate through the doorway to the east, which was previously a dark area. Once inside, I will use my senses to detect any hidden doors, passages, or stairs. Since I am a healer, I have skills that will help me to detect and navigate through this area.

If I encounter any obstacles or locked doors, I will use the kick action to try and force them open. If I find the stairs down, I will proceed to go through them to complete the task.

My high-level plan is to:

